[tamirdresher/squad-skills](https://github.com/tamirdresher/squad-skills):

- `.squad/templates/skills/cross-squad-communication/SKILL.md` — upstream
  source at [`9d871664`](https://github.com/tamirdresher/squad-skills/blob/9d871664073990d792ecb160290eebe4d841c011/plugins/cross-squad-communication/SKILL.md).
- `.squad/templates/skills/github-multi-account/SKILL.md` — adapted from the
  AI-driven setup version at [`2452efe4`](https://github.com/tamirdresher/squad-skills/blob/2452efe4855be89945e71942fb2a6c1600b6f14f/plugins/github-multi-account/SKILL.md).

